    {
      "id": "claim_805ebd528fbd4240a62dcd206ecd9fad",
      "statement": "gasbee_ble_scanner.c independently maintains an unfiltered scan list of every GasBee seen in range (gasbee_scan_entry_t), which the Display queries via RS485 cmd:\"gasbee_scan_request\" to build a bottle A/B assignment UI; a cfg_only mode restricts the list to GasBees currently in USB configuration mode.",
