        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9a7a1d1a7e9e4aa6bb7d0fe09c320047",
      "statement": "gas_source.c treats a GasBee reading as invalid for arbitration purposes unless both the GasBee's own weight_valid flag and its calibrated flag (advertising flag bit 2) are true, because an uncalibrated raw weight from a GasBee is not a meaningful gas reading even though data is being received.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://firmware/sensorboard/main/sensors/gas_source.c#L45-L47",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d68d6cbdd59cb023cce3cd969663f453351e422d17d7738a8437c5fe134c44b4:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b6602cea60004591b39d270c18834d24",
      "statement": "Switching the active gas source between HX711 and GasBee in either direction resets the consumption-rate (rate1h/rate2h) baseline in rs485_modem, preventing a raw weight jump between two physically different scales from being misread as a consumption spike or surge.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://firmware/sensorboard/README.md#L80-L80",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:70b375f1422189f5e239700a165f4f1657facdb68c724f79642109ddaf759920:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://firmware/sensorboard/main/network/espnow_modem.c#L959-L969",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:58f54ac211bfcd416b79dcae617df01395cbe279e3ffa167c4bbb18146644c77:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9626d3f387174d56a9053fe4f57ddd6b",
      "statement": "The gas topic's nc_a/nc_b (\"not connected\"/unknown) state and the \"leer\" (empty bottle) state are distinct: for a wired HX711, any reading below SENSOR_GAS_NO_BOTTLE_THRESHOLD_KG (1 kg) is reported as nc because a disconnected load cell cannot be distinguished from a genuinely unloaded scale, whereas for GasBee BLE a valid, calibrated reading below that same threshold is reported as an empty bottle (0% fill, triggering the Display's gas-empty alarm) rather than nc, since a BLE reading marked valid and calibrated has no equivalent cable-disconnect ambiguity.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://firmware/sensorboard/README.md#L82-L82",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5e79c6bd5f2eba16c314ee4fb71a439447d16a1cd5500a71ca4b75f7a9b3870a:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://firmware/sensorboard/main/network/espnow_modem.c#L978-L987",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:fbdc22a88f9c7d3fedfdc535cd8777704edb069fc08067ad33b10d1d6f61ae87:"
        }
