    },
    {
      "id": "claim_6a57bc78cf0349fd8a5c4165f6bcf012",
      "statement": "An empty/below-threshold bottle reading is never selected as the active bottle for the gas topic's \"active\" field and is never captured as a new full-bottle reference value, preventing a temporarily empty or disconnected reading from corrupting the stored full-bottle calibration reference.",
      "evidence": [
