    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c9391dad99f740dc85d4f792ef0af438",
      "statement": "The RS485 hx and gas topics, published by rs485_modem.c from gas_source_get_snapshot(), and the Sensorboard's own HTTP dashboard endpoints (/api/data, /dashboard.html) backed by the same snapshot functions are the only two consumers of GasBee/Ruuvi BLE-derived sensor data in the repository; no openHAB, MQTT broker, or other home-automation hub subscribes to this data anywhere in the codebase.",
